    {
      "id": "fb-22",
      "name": "Read this first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### How it works\nValidate Facebook brand-search relevance before classifying discussion. This manual workbench collects up to ten public posts with Apify, retains their text and nullable counts in an audit tab, and separates literal text evidence from author/context-only and missing-text results. Only bounded literal excerpts go to one OpenAI batch. Validated IDs and exact source quotes keep the classification traceable. A separate queue retains uncertain results for human review. Run summary shows the match funnel, never an exhaustive mention count.\n\n### Setup\nAllow about 15 minutes. Install the verified Apify node (0.9.0), then connect Apify, OpenAI and Google Sheets. Make a copy of the [sheet template](COPY_URL_PENDING). In node 1 paste your copy URL and edit the query; keep the default ten-post limit and $0.15 Actor charge guard. Blank run key uses the execution ID; reuse a key only to refresh the same snapshot. Human Review status is never overwritten.\n\nExpected result charges are about $0.069 plus platform overhead and one AI batch targeting under $0.01. The Actor guard is not an all-in cap. Run manually and keep inactive. Search rankings are incomplete; missing text/counts stay unknown. Treat source text as data, review ambiguous brand names, and never infer personal traits or generate replies.",
        "width": 550,
        "height": 960,
        "color": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-23",
      "name": "Setup group",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configure once\nCopy the sheet and connect all three services. All editable values live in node 1; no Code edits. This template is manual only.",
        "width": 660,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-24",
      "name": "Collection group",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        130
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Collect and partition\nPublic keyword search only. Flags plus literal text determine eligibility. Counts remain unknown when absent. Empty or malformed data stops before writes.",
        "width": 660,
        "height": 440,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fb-25",
